        only for supervisor
      X, Y, Z can be moved by
      X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z- key
           or handwheel
        service tool changer
           (double arm)
************************************
#201  S to toolchange position
#202  Z to toolchange position
#203  Y to toolchange position
#204  X to toolchange position
#205  Tool lock open
#206  Tool lock close
#207  Tool pliers close
#208  Tool pliers open
#209  Tool unclamping
#210  Tool clamping
#211  Tool arm put out
#212  Tool arm put in
#213  Tool arm turn cw (right)
#214  Tool arm turn ccw (left)
#215  Magazine turn cw (right)
#216  Magazine turn ccw (left)
#217  Magazine reference
#218  Delete spindle status (T0)
